# mauritius-internet-prices.netlify.app was this site's first home. It now only
# redirects to https://mobile-data.ramgolam.com (GitHub Pages). The Netlify project
# is not linked to this repo; deploy this folder by hand:
#   netlify deploy --prod --no-build --dir netlify-redirect --site c90d73ce-5df1-41c9-98d3-3e3e89673e59
# Files in this folder (sw.js, the Google verification file) are served as they
# are; every other path 301s to the same path on mobile-data.ramgolam.com, and
# Netlify passes the query string along. GitHub Pages serves pages with a trailing
# slash, so the two pages get it here to keep it to one hop.
/compare    https://mobile-data.ramgolam.com/compare/    301
/operators  https://mobile-data.ramgolam.com/operators/  301
/*          https://mobile-data.ramgolam.com/:splat      301
